Exception) before delegating.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'validStrategyMock'}, {'parameter': 'startIndex', 'value': '1000'}, {'parameter': 'finishIndex', 'value': '1010'}], 'expected': 'IndexOutOfBoundsException', 'description': 'Start index exceeds the size of the underlying BarSeries. The method should detect the out‑of‑range index and throw an IndexOutOfBoundsException.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'validStrategyMock'}, {'parameter': 'startIndex', 'value': '0'}, {'parameter': 'finishIndex', 'value': '1000'}], 'expected': 'IndexOutOfBoundsException', 'description': 'Finish index exceeds the size of the BarSeries. The method should validate the upper bound and throw an IndexOutOfBoundsException.'}]}]
